From: Arbion Halili <a.halili@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 22:19:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(castore/fs): include mode in inode identity

Include executable mode in regular-file inode identity so equal contents with
different modes cannot share kernel-cached attributes.

Change-Id: I49ecb0e2e541203417538fa9ba52421337e7249e
---
 snix/castore/src/fs/inode_tracker.rs | 95 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 snix/castore/src/fs/mod.rs           |  7 +-
 2 files changed, 87 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/snix/castore/src/fs/inode_tracker.rs b/snix/castore/src/fs/inode_tracker.rs
